        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/495429?u=9d0bf7e5c07194485c7f81827005599ecced9712&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Updates Safari support for the <code class=\"notranslate\">Integrity-Policy</code> HTTP header</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Implemented via <a class=\"commit-link\" data-hovercard-type=\"commit\" data-hovercard-url=\"https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/commit/2745429641071660f77d69c64cd04727ee8e31c5/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/commit/2745429641071660f77d69c64cd04727ee8e31c5\">WebKit/WebKit@<tt>2745429</tt></a> in WebKit <a href=\"https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/blob/2745429641071660f77d69c64cd04727ee8e31c5/Configurations/Version.xcconfig#L24-L26\">622.1.15</a> before Safari 26 (WebKit <a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/blob/ead83f9877ac9c8810d8854e4641e1699152730a/browsers/safari.json#L370-L376\">622.1.20</a>).</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #29433.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4231214517\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29433\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29433/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29433\">#29433</a>.</p>",
