        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/495429?u=9d0bf7e5c07194485c7f81827005599ecced9712&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Removes the CSS <code class=\"notranslate\">font-family</code> subfeatures for generic fonts, because no browser actually supports them.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The collector tests at <a href=\"https://collector.openwebdocs.org/tests/css/properties/font-family\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://collector.openwebdocs.org/tests/css/properties/font-family</a> fail in Chrome 146, Firefox 149, and Safari 26.4.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #29246.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4067860451\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29246\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29246/hovercard?comment_id=4067872654&amp;comment_type=issue_comment\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29246#issuecomment-4067872654\">#29246 (comment)</a>.</p>",
